    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Doppler of mitral inflow combined w tissue Doppler imaging of the mitral annulus can help identify and quantify LV diastol dysfun and LV filling pressures"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "In HFpEF "
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       },
       {
        "type": "highlight",
        "attrs": {
         "hex": "FF0000"
        }
       }
      ],
      "text": "LV filling = impaired"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": ": ↑LVEDP @ rest or during exertion, USU a norm LV end-diastolic vol, and norm global contractility and LVEF (≥ 50%)"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 0,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": 0,
     "spaceBefore": 6,
