    "caption": "HFpEF on echo (here from ♡ amyloidosis): mild concentric LVH (12 mm) on the parasternal long axis (A), norm LVEF of 60% (B), restrictive mitral inflow (C) and an ↑E/e' of 27.3 on tissue Doppler (D)",
    "credit": {
     "author": "Yuhei Nojima et al., The American Journal of Case Reports (2016)",
